data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Keep a queue of cells and a record of distances, with -1 for \"not reached yet\". Start with the start cell at distance 0.\nPop a cell, then for each of its four neighbours that is inside the grid, open, and not yet recorded, set its distance to\none more and enqueue it. Record the distance when you enqueue, not when you pop. If the goal is recorded, its distance is\nthe answer. If the queue empties first, the answer is -1."},"hints_note":null}

